  "description": "The Vitus Mach 3 hybrid bike joins the dots in your lifestyle. From the campsite along the meandering towpath to the picnic spot. From home to the shops. From the office to the cafe. From A to B. A bike that enables you to do more and be healthier.\n\nA bike that works for you in the real world. The epitome of multi-purpose, it combines classic hybrid versatility with modern looks and performance. Whether it’s an easy-going leisure ride or a journey with purpose, the Mach 3 is equipped for both function and comfort. Large volume, comfortable tyres are the perfect all-round choice for cycle paths, country roads or wide forest trails. The addition of mudguard points, internal cable-routing and pannier mounts make the Mach 3 a great option for year-round riding and stress-free touring.\n\nThe performance is underpinned by a classy lightweight aluminium frame that features a striking kinked top tube, designed to reduce the stepover height for when you might want to leave the activewear at home and ride out in regular clothes. We’ve purposefully selected quality, reliable components, including the latest one-piece stem and handlebar with ergo-grips, to keep weight down so the bike is low maintenance and feels reassuringly sporty.\n\nJourneys by bike are refreshing, invigorating, more enjoyable and more fun, and with the Mach 3 you can do more of them with ease and comfort.\n\nSporty looks\n\nInternal cable routing\n\nMudguard and rear rack mounts\n\nSRAM Apex 1 x 11 Speed groupset\n\nLarge volume 700c x 38 Vee G-Sport tyres\n\nHydraulic disc brakes",
